    <string name="parental_guidance_card_title">Parental Control Guide</string>
    <string name="parental_guidance_card_subtitle">How to prevent children from uninstalling the app or bypassing security</string>
    <string name="parental_guidance_card_btn">View Guide</string>
    <string name="parental_guidance_dialog_title">Comprehensive Parental Protection</string>
    <string name="parental_guidance_dialog_content">To ensure children cannot bypass Universal Installer:\n\n1. Prevent Uninstallation:\nAndroid allows uninstallation via system Settings. Use your phone\'s built-in App Lock (Samsung Secure Folder / App Lock, Xiaomi App Lock) or Google Family Link to lock the \"Settings\" app.\n\n2. Prevent Alternate Installers:\nUse the \"Freeze System Package Installer\" option below (requires Shizuku or Root) so that other apps (browsers, file managers) cannot trigger the system installer.\n\n3. Revoke Permissions:\nUse \"Revoke other apps\' install permissions\" below to ensure only Universal Installer can install packages.</string>
